# Local overrides

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md`. That copy is gitignored. It stacks on `CLAUDE.md` and does not replace it. Keep secrets out of this example. The admin password belongs only in `CLAUDE.local.md`.

## Local WordPress (Docker)

Compose project: `case-study-manager-local`

- Site URL: http://127.0.0.1:8093
- wp-admin URL: http://127.0.0.1:8093/wp-admin/
- Start: `docker compose up -d`
- Stop: `docker compose down`
- PHP: `docker compose exec -T wordpress php`
- WP-CLI: `docker compose --profile cli run --rm wpcli wp`
- Logs: `docker compose logs -f wordpress`
- Admin user:
- Admin password:
- Mounted extras:

